<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">channels</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">channels</ansi> command lists the world-wide chat channels
and lets you turn each one on or off. Toggling a channel off means you no longer
hear it (all channels are on by default).

The channels are <ansi fg="cyan">chat</ansi> (general),
<ansi fg="green">newbie</ansi> (help), and <ansi fg="yellow">trade</ansi>
(buying and selling). Talk on one with its own command, e.g.
<ansi fg="command">newbie hello</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">channels</ansi>              list all channels and their state
  <ansi fg="command">channels newbie</ansi>       toggle the newbie channel
  <ansi fg="command">channels trade off</ansi>    turn the trade channel off
  <ansi fg="command">channels trade on</ansi>     turn the trade channel on
